  "description": "Compile-time INotifyPropertyChanged source generator for .NET. One [Notify] attribute generates equality-guarded properties with no runtime package and no required ObservableObject base class — use it beside CommunityToolkit.Mvvm commands.\n\nFeatures:\n• Auto-generates properties with PropertyChanged notifications\n• Built-in equality guards prevent redundant events\n• Partial hooks: On{Property}Changing(oldValue, newValue) and On{Property}Changed()\n• [NotifyAlso] for dependent properties, child changes, and collection membership\n• Reuse existing INPC host invokers without duplicate events or runtime dependencies\n• Forward [property:]/[get:]/[set:] field attributes onto generated members\n• [NotifySetter] for access control (private, protected, internal)\n• INotifyPropertyChanging support for undo/redo scenarios\n• [NotifyCanExecuteChangedFor] for automatic command refresh\n• [NotifySuppressable] for batch notification suppression\n• Nested [Notify] class support with generic declaration preservation\n• Analyzer diagnostics and code fixes for invalid partial declarations, underscore field names, and unknown NotifyAlso names\n• Works with WPF, MAUI, Blazor, Avalonia, Uno Platform, WinUI, and Xamarin\n• AOT compatible and trimming safe",
  "developmentDependency": true,
